claim('E07','C3','The recorded merge credits vicjuma and pablomartin4btc for the top commit.','supported',[('merge_message','ACKs for top commit:'),('merge_message','vicjuma:'),('merge_message','pablomartin4btc:')],'This verifies final recorded attribution, not the exact earlier reclassification path.')
claim('E07','C4','The reminder demonstrably caused an observed hash edit and bot update at their displayed creation times.','unresolved',[('comments:4','(Without a hash, no one can know what the comment is referring to)'),('reviews:3','ACK 9f0543d69a1357371017c8289d9addc457b6f132'),('comments:0','[vicjuma](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36127#pullrequestreview-5078624594)')],'Edit history is absent. Preserve a plausible correction mechanism without assigning a fabricated time or causal effect.')

claim('E08','C1','After merge, maflcko states a sufficiency threshold for relatively simple test PRs.','attributed',[('comments:4','And for rather simple pulls, such as this one, I try to merge quickly. Two utACK or one tested ACK should be sufficient.'),('outcome','"merged_at": "2017-11-22T16:34:02+00:00"')],'This is a scoped justification, not a universal mandatory threshold. The statement follows the recorded merge.')
