claim('E11','C3','The meeting left a decision open for comments; its suggested week of PR exposure exceeds the observed 3.46-day open-to-merge interval.','supported',[('irc_decision',None),('irc_wait',None),('outcome',None)],'The waiting period was an expressed expectation with assent, not an established binding minimum. PR duration is not the length of the entire selection process.')
